<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RM_RotSporeKit_SheenHediffs.xml        RotSporeKit - ROT_SHEEN_WEATHER_1 build pass

  rot_kit_spec.md M1 ("The Sheen"), ticket 2, owner card 5 (RULED
  2026-09-17): "gear only slows the exposure clock (4x), never full
  immunity... the symbiont remains the only true immunity."

  RM_SheenCoating: the exposure ladder. Bootstrapped onto every eligible
  pawn at near-zero severity by RM_SheenExposureLock's carrierHediff
  (GameConditionDefs/RM_SheenExposureLock.xml, EnvironmentalWeatherExtension
  - same shape RM_MiasmaWeatherLock already ships), then its own comp
  (HediffCompProperties_SheenExposure, RimMandrake.EnvironmentalHazards) does
  the real per-day severity math:
    - accrues only while the map's current weather is one of
      RM_SheenFall/RM_SheenStorm/RM_SheenMist AND the pawn is unroofed;
    - the applied rate is severityPerDayExposed * max(minDriveFactor,
      1 - apparel-summed RM_SheenProtection) - the chitin spider helmet's
      0.75 gives exactly a 4x slowdown (1 - 0.75 = 0.25), and minDriveFactor
      0.05 is a structural floor enforcing card 5's "never full immunity
      from gear" even if a future item stacked protection toward 1.0;
    - zeroed entirely (not just slowed) while the pawn carries
      RM_SheenSymbiosis - card 5's "only true immunity".

  severityPerDayExposed 0.667 reaches this hediff's own top stage
  (minSeverity 1.0) in 1.5 in-game days unprotected - the spec's own
  INVENTED anchor ("~1.5 in-game days of continuous exposure"). At the
  helmet's 4x slowdown that becomes ~6 days, matching the ticket's proof
  step. severityPerDayUnexposed -0.3 is this pass's own INVENTED decay rate
  (the spec names no figure), close to RM_MiasmaExposure's -0.2 precedent
  but a little faster since the Sheen's own sheet frames it as ambient
  rather than a lingering toxin.

  Top-stage hediffGivers -> RM_SporeFlesh with a short mtbDays (0.25 days,
  this pass's own INVENTED-BUILD tuning) rather than a guaranteed instant
  seed: HediffGiver_Random is the vanilla mechanism (RM_HediffSkulltopSpores
  already uses it in this same mod for an identical "top stage seeds a
  disease" shape) and the ticket names this as one of two acceptable
  build-time picks. A guaranteed give would need custom C#, unneeded here.

  RM_SheenSymbiosis: defined here (ticket 2's own scope: "def ships here,
  granted by ticket 5") but inert grant-wise this pass - nothing yet applies
  it. ROT_LIVE_PREPARATIONS_1's Sheenblood symbiont pair is the eventual
  grantor. isBad false / no comps: it is a pure marker other mechanisms read
  (RM_SheenCoating's immunityHediff here; the sunlight-scald half of the
  Sheenblood bargain is ticket 5's own build).
-->
<Defs>

  <HediffDef>
    <defName>RM_SheenCoating</defName>
    <label>Sheen coating</label>
    <description>A film of the Rot's own reproductive Sheen, built up from standing unprotected in Sheen-fall. Cosmetic at first — a faint gloss on skin and gear — but left to climb it seeds mycelia deep enough to become spore flesh.</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.85, 0.85, 1.0)</defaultLabelColor>
    <comps>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.EnvironmentalHazards.HediffCompProperties_SheenExposure" MayRequire="mandrake.rm.environmentalhazards">
        <onlyDuringWeathers>
          <li>RM_SheenFall</li>
          <li>RM_SheenStorm</li>
          <li>RM_SheenMist</li>
        </onlyDuringWeathers>
        <severityPerDayExposed>0.667</severityPerDayExposed>
        <severityPerDayUnexposed>-0.3</severityPerDayUnexposed>
        <protectionStat>RM_SheenProtection</protectionStat>
        <minDriveFactor>0.05</minDriveFactor>
        <immunityHediff>RM_SheenSymbiosis</immunityHediff>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>sheened</label>
        <becomeVisible>false</becomeVisible>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>sheened</label>
        <minSeverity>0.05</minSeverity>
        <becomeVisible>true</becomeVisible>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>saturated</label>
        <minSeverity>1.0</minSeverity>
        <hediffGivers>
          <li Class="HediffGiver_Random">
            <hediff>RM_SporeFlesh</hediff>
            <mtbDays>0.25</mtbDays>
          </li>
        </hediffGivers>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

  <HediffDef>
    <defName>RM_SheenSymbiosis</defName>
    <label>Sheen symbiosis</label>
    <description>The Rot's mycelial network has folded this body fully into itself. Sheen-fall that would coat and eventually infect an outsider passes through a symbiont unnoticed — the only true immunity the Rot recognizes. Granted by drinking the Sheenblood tea.</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.85, 0.75, 1.0)</defaultLabelColor>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>symbiotic</label>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

</Defs>
